    the hours of work of fay in 2027-04-01 is 40.
    the hours of work of fay in 2027-06-01 is 50.
    the monthly income of fay in 2027-01-01 is 400.
    the monthly income of fay in 2027-02-01 is 400.
    the monthly income of fay in 2027-03-01 is 400.
    the monthly income of fay in 2027-04-01 is 400.
    the monthly income of fay in 2027-05-01 is 400.
    the monthly income of fay in 2027-06-01 is 400.
    decision expects answers ["the decision for fay is unable to verify: notice of noncompliance, 30 days to show compliance"].
    applicable expects answers ["fay is subject to the requirement"].
    exempt expects answers [].
    meets expects answers ["fay meets the requirement in 2027-03-01"].
    reasons expects answers ["fay meets the requirement in 2027-03-01 because at least 80 hours of work"].
    short expects answers ["fay falls short in 2027-01-01", "fay falls short in 2027-02-01", "fay falls short in 2027-04-01", "fay falls short in 2027-05-01", "fay falls short in 2027-06-01"].

% The State converts income into hours of work where no hours are documented
