    meets expects answers ["gus meets the requirement in 2027-02-01"].
    reasons expects answers ["gus meets the requirement in 2027-02-01 because at least 80 hours of activities combined"].
    short expects answers ["gus falls short in 2027-01-01", "gus falls short in 2027-03-01", "gus falls short in 2027-04-01", "gus falls short in 2027-05-01", "gus falls short in 2027-06-01"].

