    applicable expects answers ["jo is subject to the requirement"].
    exempt expects answers ["hana is excluded from the requirement because a parent, guardian, caretaker relative or family caregiver", "ana is excluded from the requirement because a parent, guardian, caretaker relative or family caregiver", "cy is excluded from the requirement because a parent, guardian, caretaker relative or family caregiver"].
    meets expects answers ["hana meets the requirement in 2027-02-01", "ana meets the requirement in 2027-02-01", "cy meets the requirement in 2027-02-01"].
    reasons expects answers ["hana meets the requirement in 2027-02-01 because a parent, guardian, caretaker relative or family caregiver", "ana meets the requirement in 2027-02-01 because a parent, guardian, caretaker relative or family caregiver", "cy meets the requirement in 2027-02-01 because a parent, guardian, caretaker relative or family caregiver"].
    short expects answers ["jo falls short in 2027-02-01"].

